<title>USA: Altavista IPO could come later in January-Lehman.</title>
<headline>Altavista IPO could come later in January-Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of AltaVista Internet Software Inc could come later this month, according to underwriter Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>However, the underwriter stressed no date has been firmly scheduled and said no further details were available.</p>
<p>AltaVista, a unit of Digital Equipment Corp, has one of the most powerful Internet search engines and also designs Internet software. The company is tentatively scheduled to trade on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;ALTV&quot;.</p>
</text>
